@--[15]. From these things it may now be evident what is meant by "the nets," etc. which are so often mentioned in the New Testament. Illustrated.

@--[17]. There are good natural men and evil natural men, and the separation of these appears in the Spiritual World like a net -rete seu sagena- let out into the sea, drawing together the fish, and hauling them up on the shore.

