@--[end]. The end of a former, and the beginning of a new state. Signified.

@4063[2]. The new man is altogether different from the old. Described.

@4067[4]. The middle delights and goods by which man is led by the Lord from the state of the old man to the state of the new man. Explained.

@4292. A new given quality. Signified, Explained.

@4299[2]. Conscience is the new will and new understanding from the Lord...

