@4727[2]. Love to the Lord and charity towards the neighbour are what make man new.

@4729. This worst falsity... is not eradicated except by a new life from the Lord.

@4904[2]. Should put off the old man, that is, the loves of self and of the world... and should put on the new, that is, love towards the neighbour and to God.

@5079. That they were contrary to the new state of the natural man. Signified, Explained.

@5113[14]. "Until that day when I shall drink it new with you" (Matthew 26:29). Explained. @AE 376[26].

@5159. A new state with the man who is being regenerated begins when the order is inverted...

@5351. "Manasseh" = the new Voluntary in the Natural. Explained.

@5353. The new Voluntary comes forth by the influx of good from the Lord. Explained.

@5354. "Ephraim" = the new Intellectual in the Natural. Explained.

@--[2]. When, evils having been removed, man receives the influx, he then receives a new will and a new Intellectual; and from the new will he feels delight in benefiting the neighbour from no end for self, and from the new Intellectual he apperceives delight in learning what is good and true for their own sake and for the sake of life. As this new Intellectual and new Voluntary come forth by influx from the Lord, therefore he who has been regenerated acknowledges and believes that the good and truth with which he is affected are not from himself, but from the Lord...

@5526[2]. From this good there is formed with man a new will...

@5595. A new will in the Intellectual part... @6854[2]. @8806[2].

@5651[2]. That the old man is to be put off, and the new one put on.

@--[4]. Then man is gifted with a new Natural...

@5773[2]. With this good a new will is insinuated; and, with this, new freedom, thus a new proprium. Signified.

@5804. Thence comes truth which is new. Signified, Explained. @5812.

@5812. The man then receives what is new of life through this new truth conjoined with good. Signified.

@5954. "Changes of garments" = truths which are new; and truths become new when they are initiated to good...

@5972. New life. Signified, Explained. @6036.

@6392[end]. For this is in the new will...

@6645. The end of a former state, and the beginning of a new one. Signified, Explained.

